* LT3045-1 3.3V LDO Regulator
.lib LT3045-1.sub

* Input Supply (5V)
V1 IN 0 5
C1 IN 0 10u

* LT3045-1 Subcircuit Instantiation
* Pin Order: IN EN_UV PG ILIM VIOC SET GND OUTS OUT
X1 IN IN PG 0 NC_VIOC SET 0 OUT OUT LT3045-1

* SET Pin Programming (VOUT = 100uA * R_SET)
* For 3.3V output: R_SET = 3.3V / 100uA = 33kOhm
R_SET SET 0 33k
* Small SET capacitor for stability and fast simulation settling
C_SET SET 0 1n

* Power Good Pull-up
R_PG IN PG 100k

* VIOC Pin (Floating, tied to dummy 1G resistor to prevent floating node errors)
R_VIOC NC_VIOC 0 1G

* Output Capacitance and Load (100mA at 3.3V -> 33 Ohms)
C_OUT OUT 0 10u
R_LOAD OUT 0 33

* Transient Analysis to measure DC settled output
.tran 0 2m

.end
